        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko uku kwerekwa kwose kwababereye nk’amajambo yo mu gitabu kimatanishijwe ishashara. Mugihaye uwushobora gusoma mukamubwira muti: “Turakwinginze udusomere,” yobabwira ati: “Sinoshobora gusoma kuko kiramatanije.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mugihaye uwutazi gusoma na we mukamubwira muti: “Turakwinginze udusomere,” yobishura ati: “Sinzi gusoma.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.12"
            ]
